<p>While sustained, this ability speeds up outgoing projectiles by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">71%, 95%, 114%, 131%, 145%</acronym> while slowing incoming projectiles by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29%, 32%, 34%, 36%, 37%.</acronym> The increase and decrease improve with your spellpower</p>